{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introducing the ultimate mind game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simple game in which players choose a Samurai, Ninja, Monk, Merchant, or Villager and try to guess the character selected by their opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use three types of commands: conversation, yawn, and tea to get closer to the character selected by your opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has its own personality, so you need to develop a strategy based on the order in which you play them and their compatibility with your opponent's character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk until the morning in a 1-on-1 read-the-money game that requires no skill!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Reached Iron","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3552900/73e9eae93ef0149e9a0da1c284fe69a7df9aa1a0.jpg"},{"name":"Reached Bronze","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3552900/fe3b155c891a4f7343aa52301006de4baa263124.jpg"},{"name":"Reached Silver","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3552900/a6c959f1558d4f5b2100af6000cf74f1cf6cb852.jpg"},{"name":"Reached Gold","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3552900/d04bf27a8077cf4e9d926780ceb5f21d9fe3903c.jpg"},{"name":"Reached Platinum","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3552900/f60d1c062ecd8daf2b93f6226e72aaf2436115eb.jpg"},{"name":"Reached Diamond","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3552900/9ff606dc75edc0e381a85f1125ab7edac7e2d467.jpg"},{"name":"Reached Legend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3552900/8310aa0abfabe31e149fc8d2d0521bab809d9614.jpg"},{"name":"1 ranked match won","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3552900/27639902e7062f028c4af5199c88b62ccf3c5662.